The `Logger` class also includes a thread-safe mechanism to handle concurrent log entries efficiently, ensuring minimal impact on system performance during peak loads. This is achieved by using a mutex to synchronize access to the logging file stream.

The `Logging` namespace is designed to be modular and easy to integrate with external monitoring tools and third-party analytics services. The `Logger` class can be used in conjunction with other libraries and frameworks to provide a flexible and scalable logging framework for high-throughput network service applications.']

