| `NONCE` | `unsigned char*` | The nonce used to generate a unique initialization vector (IV). |
| `HMAC_KEY` | `const unsigned char*` | The key used for generating an HMAC using SHA-256. |

### Encryption and Decryption Functions

The following functions are used for encryption and decryption:

| Function Name | Description |
