| `encryptData()` | Encrypts the data using AES-256-GCM and generates an HMAC using SHA-256. The function returns the encrypted data as a byte array of size equal to the original data size plus 16 bytes (IV). |
| `decryptData()` | Decrypts the encrypted data using AES-256-GCM and verifies an HMAC using SHA-256. The function returns the decrypted data as a byte array of size equal to the original data size minus 16 bytes (IV). |

### Key Exchange Functions

The following functions are used for key exchange:

